# "Max speed — [ability]" is a static ability of the permanent that grants it the ability while its controller's speed is
# 4 (CR 702.178a, 613.1f): a permanent that has lost all its abilities has no max speed ability to grant anything. Bot1
# reaches max speed with Perilous Snare and Lightning Bolts on turns 1, 3 and 5 (CR 704.5aa, 702.179d), and on turn 5 the
# Snare's ability puts a counter on Bot1's Ornithopter, the positive control. On turn 6 Bot2's Oko, Thief of Crowns makes
# the Snare an Elk that has lost all abilities. On turn 7 Bot1 still has speed 4, it is Bot1's main phase, the Snare is
# untapped and the Ornithopter is there to target, but the ability is not offered.

